                        <description>Abstract   This paper proposes a local fuzzy based damping controller (LFDC) for thyristor controlled series capacitor (TCSC) to improve transient stability of power systems. In order to implement the proposed scheme, detailed model of TCSC, based on actual behavior of thyristor valves, is adopted. The LFDC uses the frequency at the TCSC bus as a local feedback signal, to control the firing angle. The parameters of fuzzy controller are tuned using an off-line method through chaotic optimization </description> 
