                        <description>&lt;p&gt;While we were finalizing this book, the corona virus pandemic struck. It affected all countries around the world, causing heavy human suffering everywhere.&lt;/p&gt;                &lt;p&gt;Its economic consequences can probably be expected to be dire for many LFDCs, of which most are low-income countries.&lt;/p&gt;                &lt;p&gt;At the time of writing, the severity of the longer-term consequences of the pandemic for these countries is difficult to gauge. We nevertheless feel it necessary to briefly assess</description> 
